### 1. GET Semua Produk
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 2. GET Detail Produk by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 3. POST Tambah Produk Baru
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sepatu Lari Nike",
  "description": "Ukuran 42 warna hitam",
  "price": 850000.0,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "Sepatu"
}

### 4. PUT Update Produk by ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Gayo Arabika 250g",
  "description": "Promo diskon akhir pekan!",
  "price": 75000.0,
  "stock": 100,
  "category": "Minuman"
}

### 5. DELETE Produk by ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/2
